{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在內"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出金湯集"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "󳬴在淨□東禪秀峯眾承天"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一攝眾，二\n歡喜，三信心，四精進，五消渴，六慚愧，七生善，八好聲，九有色，十資身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一輕軟，二淨潔，三如法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甘辛苦鹹酸淡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出無量須知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從東起"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "結制、　解制、　至節、　献歲，　或云陳賀\n名德人甲"}
