{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "榜式在前，侍者具禮請首座。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "茶禮見前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "湯同請茶，早以香詣方丈請。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "結制至節，　解制献歲"}
