{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "常云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "資助尊靈，稱揚十念。西方"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大夜維那念誦，稱之者兩字名，餘回向一字名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一安度牒，一安稱資"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若用法事迎引，從童行堂至土地堂，反大殿，然後入信堂內剃頭行\n者，諸處各禮三拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於戒師前，大展禮三拜，胡跪合掌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "問"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已集。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "和合。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為當院行者某甲剃\n領受戒。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "𠬧坐具起，引行者入堂。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於聖僧前禮三拜，聞磬聲禮，聞磬聲起，又禮戒師三拜，胡跪合掌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作優波離𣑽，如不能師作云何𣑽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "呪香"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "聞𣑽聲，秉爐至微密處，呪香并薰。顯戒文云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵終疊云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "秉爐云：請師言句，汝合自陳。汝若不能，隨我聲道，至某田受稱名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。第三疊，慈愍故三遍。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第一、第二、第三，各小禮三拜，又三禮三拜，胡跪合掌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "每呼善男子，即當應諾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "收坐具起，引行者同問訊出堂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於堂下拜辭國王父母，撿俗服，着直裰訖，引請闍棃，引於聖像前禮三拜，就戒師座一禮\n一拜，近前胡跪合掌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誦偈，執瓶水灌頂，并剃髮少許，傍僧同誦"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說，沙彌退身禮一拜。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引行者於本師座前禮一拜，近前胡跪合掌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說，退身禮一拜，復於師前胡跪合掌。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一說付之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禮本師三拜，禮聖像三拜，禮戒師三拜，胡跪合掌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦展坐具，胡跪合掌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "兼以至十戒意。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。第三疊，慈愍故，三遍。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第一、第二、第三，各小禮一拜，一大禮三拜，胡跪合掌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三問三答："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大禮三拜，胡跪合掌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三問三答："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大禮三拜，胡跪合掌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作神仙梵云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "聞梵聲，秉爐至梵終，回向云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "聞處世界收坐具起，令沙彌禮拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如法堂上剃頭，即於法堂內禮賀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一展□：蒙差受戒，不敢固辭。入事荒□□，淹尊重。下情無任皇恐之至。又一展：\n敘寒伏暄，惟和尚尊體起居萬福。仍又禮三拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云：此者沙彌受戒，有煩證明，即容詣寮陳謝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大展三拜云：沙彌得度，舉眾同歡。仰對尊慈，倍深喜躍。又三拜。敘時暄，又\n禮三拜也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云：叨員頂相，幸掛田衣。遂脫塵牢，永拋憂網。下情無任感激之至。三\n禮。敘寒暄，又禮三拜。住持人巡寮過，乃禮知事、頭首、戒師、闍梨并諸法眷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "萬歲天恩，\n令節時啟，霜臺三飜。羯磨既員，已登戒品。此盖某人宿承佛記，誓度羣迷。時將繫草之心，上答浮囊之賜。下情\n無任感激之至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "X63n1250_p0661c15"}
